      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-301272",
      ":question/problem": "A nutritionist randomly sampled $800$ adults about their preferred type of breakfast. The results are shown in the table below.\n\n| Breakfast Preference | Number of Adults |\n| --- | ---: |\n| Cereal | $280$ |\n| Toast | $190$ |\n| Fruit | $150$ |\n| Other | $180$ |\n\nThe city has $45,000$ adults in total. Based on the survey results, what is the best estimate of the number of adults in the city whose preferred breakfast is cereal or toast?\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
